{"language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.82, "text": " They went to the bathroom like this in the 1600s, which helped spread diseases like typhoid fever.", "words": [{"word": " They", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.18}, {"word": " went", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.36}, {"word": " to", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.48}, {"word": " the", "start": 0.48, "end": 0.62}, {"word": " bathroom", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.88}, {"word": " like", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.08}, {"word": " this", "start": 1.08, "end": 1.36}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.36, "end": 1.48}, {"word": " the", "start": 1.48, "end": 1.64}, {"word": " 1600s,", "start": 1.64, "end": 2.44}, {"word": " which", "start": 2.52, "end": 2.6}, {"word": " helped", "start": 2.6, "end": 2.84}, {"word": " spread", "start": 2.84, "end": 3.2}, {"word": " diseases", "start": 3.2, "end": 3.66}, {"word": " like", "start": 3.66, "end": 3.94}, {"word": " typhoid", "start": 3.94, "end": 4.46}, {"word": " fever.", "start": 4.46, "end": 4.82}]}, {"start": 5.3, "end": 9.9, "text": " They went to the bathroom like this in the 1800s, and people were still getting sick because they didn't learn.", "words": [{"word": " They", "start": 5.3, "end": 5.38}, {"word": " went", "start": 5.38, "end": 5.54}, {"word": " to", "start": 5.54, "end": 5.66}, {"word": " the", "start": 5.66, "end": 5.78}, {"word": " bathroom", "start": 5.78, "end": 6.02}, {"word": " like", "start": 6.02, "end": 6.22}, {"word": " this", "start": 6.22, "end": 6.58}, {"word": " in", "start": 6.58, "end": 6.76}, {"word": " the", "start": 6.76, "end": 6.86}, {"word": " 1800s,", "start": 6.86, "end": 7.62}, {"word": " and", "start": 7.62, "end": 7.72}, {"word": " people", "start": 7.72, "end": 7.94}, {"word": " were", "start": 7.94, "end": 8.12}, {"word": " still", "start": 8.12, "end": 8.36}, {"word": " getting", "start": 8.36, "end": 8.6}, {"word": " sick", "start": 8.6, "end": 8.84}, {"word": " because", "start": 8.84, "end": 9.1}, {"word": " they", "start": 9.1, "end": 9.28},